      "max_discern_points_on_missense": 3.0,
      "lp_threshold_points": 6.0,
      "n_reaching_lp_or_p": 0,
      "finding": "On intrinsic sequence evidence alone the ACMG point system cannot reach a pathogenic band for a missense variant: PM2 plus PP3 tops out well below the 6 points Likely Pathogenic requires. Every band DISCERN resolves on this surface is therefore benign-side, and the pathogenic side is left explicitly uncertain. That is the partition behaving as specified - the criteria that carry missense pathogenicity (PS3 functional, PS4 case-control, PM1 hotspot, PM5, PP4 phenotype) are owned by the functional, disease and coupling factors and are not derivable from sequence. It is also, stated plainly, the reason the coupling matters: the missing evidence is exactly what a disease model supplies."
    },
